#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:2
msgid "Virtio balloon memory statistics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:4
msgid ""
"The virtio balloon driver supports guest memory statistics reporting. These "
"statistics are available to QEMU users as QOM (QEMU Object Model) device "
"properties via a polling mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:8
msgid ""
"Before querying the available stats, clients first have to enable polling. "
"This is done by writing a time interval value (in seconds) to the guest-"
"stats-polling-interval property. This value can be:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:14
msgid "> 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:13
msgid ""
"enables polling in the specified interval. If polling is already enabled, "
"the polling time interval is changed to the new value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:18
msgid "0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:17
msgid ""
"disables polling. Previous polled statistics are still valid and can be "
"queried."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:20
msgid ""
"Once polling is enabled, the virtio-balloon device in QEMU will start "
"polling the guest's balloon driver for new stats in the specified time "
"interval."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:24
msgid ""
"To retrieve those stats, clients have to query the guest-stats property, "
"which will return a VirtioBalloonGuestStats (see QAPI documentation)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:27
msgid "It's also important to note the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:29
msgid ""
"Previously polled statistics remain available even if the polling is later "
"disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:32
msgid ""
"As noted above, if a guest doesn't support a particular stat its value will "
"always be -1. However, it's also possible that a guest temporarily couldn't "
"update one or even all stats. If this happens, just wait for the next update"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:37
msgid ""
"Polling can be enabled even if the guest doesn't have stats support or the "
"balloon driver wasn't loaded in the guest. If this is the case and stats are "
"queried, last-update will be 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:41
msgid ""
"The polling timer is only re-armed when the guest responds to the statistics "
"request. This means that if a (buggy) guest doesn't ever respond to the "
"request the timer will never be re-armed, which has the same effect as "
"disabling polling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:46
msgid ""
"Here are a few examples. QEMU is started with ``-device virtio-balloon``, "
"which generates ``/machine/peripheral-anon/device[1]`` as the QOM path for "
"the balloon device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:50
msgid "Enable polling with 2 seconds interval::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:52
msgid ""
"{ \"execute\": \"qom-set\",\n"
"             \"arguments\": { \"path\": \"/machine/peripheral-anon/"
"device[1]\",\n"
"             \"property\": \"guest-stats-polling-interval\", \"value\": "
"2 } }\n"
"\n"
"{ \"return\": {} }"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:58
msgid "Change polling to 10 seconds::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:60
msgid ""
"{ \"execute\": \"qom-set\",\n"
"             \"arguments\": { \"path\": \"/machine/peripheral-anon/"
"device[1]\",\n"
"             \"property\": \"guest-stats-polling-interval\", \"value\": "
"10 } }\n"
"\n"
"{ \"return\": {} }"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:66
msgid "Get stats::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:68
msgid ""
"{ \"execute\": \"qom-get\",\n"
"             \"arguments\": { \"path\": \"/machine/peripheral-anon/"
"device[1]\",\n"
"             \"property\": \"guest-stats\" } }\n"
"{\n"
"  \"return\": {\n"
"      \"stats\": {\n"
"          \"stat-swap-out\": 0,\n"
"          \"stat-free-memory\": 844943360,\n"
"          \"stat-minor-faults\": 219028,\n"
"          \"stat-major-faults\": 235,\n"
"          \"stat-total-memory\": 1044406272,\n"
"          \"stat-swap-in\": 0\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"last-update\": 1358529861\n"
"  }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:85
msgid "Disable polling::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/virtio-balloon-stats.rst:87
msgid ""
"{ \"execute\": \"qom-set\",\n"
"             \"arguments\": { \"path\": \"/machine/peripheral-anon/"
"device[1]\",\n"
"             \"property\": \"stats-polling-interval\", \"value\": 0 } }\n"
"\n"
"{ \"return\": {} }"
msgstr ""
